  "description": "OmniSat is a self-supervised multimodal fusion model for Earth Observation, capable of combining diverse EO modalities (very high resolution images, optical and SAR time series) into expressive features without labels, achieving state-of-the-art results on forestry, land cover, and crop mapping tasks.",
